inear lookup table, FITS Paper 3, Sect 6.1  CRVAL1W =                    1 / [pixel] Lookup table is in raw FITS coordinatesCRVAL2W =                    1 / [pixel] Lookup table is in raw FITS coordinatesPV1_3W  =                    1 / Index of wavelength in VALUES array            PV2_3W  =                    2 / Index of bandwidth in VALUES array             PS1_0W  = 'WCS-WAVE'           / Extension with wavelength lookup table         PS2_0W  = 'WCS-WAVE'           / Extension with bandwidth lookup table          PS1_1W  = 'VALUES  '           / Column with values for wavelength              PS2_1W  = 'VALUES  '           / Column with values for bandwidth               PS1_2W  = 'X       '           / Column with control points for detector in X   PS2_2W  = 'Y       '           / Column with control points for detector in Y   END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 